    <string name="about_highlight">&lt;b&gt;Built for file transfer and privacy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;ErikrafT Drop™ focuses on file transfer and privacy. It aims to adapt to a wide range of devices, from older and legacy systems to modern hardware, offering compatible options where possible. Availability depends on the device, operating system, and supported technologies.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Help improve ErikrafT Drop™&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Contribute a Pull Request to fix a problem or add a feature, or open an Issue with diagnostic details and steps to reproduce what happened. Clear reports and contributions help make the app more reliable for everyone.</string>
